cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ooda-harness: a durable OODA-loop agent harness with Jev and a small vLLM-served model"
abstract: >-
  An agent harness that works through a task in repeated cycles of observe,
  orient, decide and act. A small chat model served by vLLM does the work with
  file and shell tools. Jev, a decision model that returns calibrated
  probabilities for typed questions, classifies the task's Cynefin domain,
  judges acceptance criteria and screens tool calls. Its answers are fused over
  time. Every step is committed to storage through pi-durable, so interrupted
  work resumes where it stopped. A separate loop changes the harness settings
  one at a time and keeps a change only when a task suite's objective checks
  favour it.
